    <div class="sb reveal" data-d="3"><div class="n"><span data-count="100" data-suffix="%"></span></div><div class="l">Senior-led, founder-aligned work</div></div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<!-- APPROACH -->
<section class="section surface-page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="left">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="sec-index">02</span> &nbsp;How we work</span>
        <h2 class="h2 reveal" data-d="1">Principles that hold<br />on the ground.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="muted reveal" data-d="2" style="max-width:34ch">We keep engagements small, senior and accountable — measured by partners signed, not slides delivered.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="approach-grid">
      <div class="ap reveal"><div class="k">i.</div><h3 class="h3">Channel-first</h3><p>Distribution is the strategy. We design the route to market and the partners who carry it — not a deck that sits on a shelf.</p></div>
      <div class="ap reveal" data-d="1"><div class="k">ii.</div><h3 class="h3">Founder-aligned</h3><p>Senior attention and candid counsel, with incentives tied to traction. You work with principals, every meeting.</p></div>
      <div class="ap reveal" data-d="2"><div class="k">iii.</div><h3 class="h3">Evidence over theory</h3><p>Every recommendation is grounded in real demand signals and real conversations with the market — not assumption.</p></div>
      <div class="ap reveal"><div class="k">iv.</div><h3 class="h3">Warm, not cold</h3><p>We open doors through relationships we already hold. Introductions arrive with trust attached, so they convert.</p></div>
      <div class="ap reveal" data-d="1"><div class="k">v.</div><h3 class="h3">Sequenced, not open-ended</h3><p>Clear phases with defined outcomes. You always know what comes next and what it costs — no drifting retainers.</p></div>
      <div class="ap reveal" data-d="2"><div class="k">vi.</div><h3 class="h3">Built to hand over</h3><p>Success is your team running the engine without us. We transfer the relationships and the playbook, then step back.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

